@startuml 019-customer-dashboard-seq-lifecycle
title Customer Dashboard - Data Aggregation Sequence

actor Customer
participant "CustomerDashboardV1Controller" as Ctrl
participant "CustomerDashboardService" as Svc
database "Database" as DB

Customer -> Ctrl: GET /api/v1/customer/dashboard
activate Ctrl
Ctrl -> Svc: getDashboard(currentUser)
activate Svc

== 1. Aggregate Counters (Top Row Widgets) ==
Svc -> DB: countActiveByCustomerId (CONFIRMED/CHECKED_IN)
Svc -> DB: countPendingDepositByCustomerId (PENDING_DEPOSIT)
Svc -> DB: countByCustomerIdAndStatus (Payment: PENDING)
Svc -> Svc: calc pendingPayments = pendingDeposit + pendingPayment
Svc -> DB: countByCustomerIdAndStatusIn (Maintenance: OPEN/IN_PROGRESS)
Svc -> DB: countByUserIdAndIsReadFalse (Notification)

== 2. Upcoming Events (Check-in / Check-out highlights) ==
Svc -> DB: findFirst (Booking = CONFIRMED, checkIn >= today)
Svc -> DB: findFirst (Booking = CHECKED_IN, checkOut >= today)

== 3. Recent Activity Lists ==
Svc -> DB: findUpcomingByCustomerId (Limit 5)
Svc -> DB: findByCustomerIdOrderByCreatedAtDesc (Payments Limit 3)
Svc -> DB: findByUserIdOrderByCreatedAtDesc (Notifications Limit 5)

== 4. Build Response ==
Svc -> Svc: Map to CustomerDashboardResponse
Svc --> Ctrl: CustomerDashboardResponse
deactivate Svc
Ctrl --> Customer: 200 OK
deactivate Ctrl
@enduml
